1
00:01:42,159 --> 00:01:43,560
If you're short on cash, go to Zhong'an.

2
00:01:43,959 --> 00:01:45,200
They're short on talent,

3
00:01:45,640 --> 00:01:46,920
and they pay top dollar.

4
00:01:49,480 --> 00:01:50,280
You...

5
00:01:54,159 --> 00:01:54,879
The way I see it,

6
00:01:55,040 --> 00:01:56,040
the Silent Protectors

7
00:01:56,239 --> 00:01:57,439
are practically becoming a branch of Zhong'an.

8
00:02:01,480 --> 00:02:02,480
Not eating?

9
00:02:06,319 --> 00:02:07,319
I'll eat by myself, then.

10
00:02:40,719 --> 00:02:42,120
Mr. Xiang, over here.

11
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:49,479
Dad, it's me.

12
00:02:54,159 --> 00:02:55,960
Since when did you change lines of work?

13
00:02:55,960 --> 00:02:58,280
I was just testing your vi... vigilance.

14
00:02:58,280 --> 00:02:59,240
So, how did I do?

15
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:00,400
Sharp as ever.

16
00:03:03,919 --> 00:03:04,960
What are you doing here?

17
00:03:05,879 --> 00:03:07,960
I just missed you and my brother.

18
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:09,360
Besides, I don't have any assignments right now,

19
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:11,400
so I wanted to come see Antilocaris.

20
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:13,159
Maybe I could even help Zhong'an out.

21
00:03:13,159 --> 00:03:14,199
You, help?

22
00:03:15,400 --> 00:03:16,960
Just don't cause trouble.

23
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:18,759
Always acting without asking first.

24
00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:22,479
Where's your ticket? What row?

25
00:03:25,360 --> 00:03:26,520
Row seven, seat 15.

26
00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:28,240
No, row seven, seat five.

27
00:03:31,280 --> 00:03:33,439
Now it's row seven, seat 16. Right with you.

28
00:03:37,639 --> 00:03:39,840
Don't speak, and don't move.

29
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:41,759
Try to run, and you're dead.

30
00:03:41,759 --> 00:03:42,960
Just sit right here and behave,

31
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:44,400
and you might just make it out alive.

32
00:03:44,919 --> 00:03:46,759
All right? Good luck.

33
00:04:17,279 --> 00:04:17,920
Dad!

34
00:04:30,639 --> 00:04:31,560
Douglas.

35
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:33,240
I'm tied up.

36
00:04:33,480 --> 00:04:35,000
Help me untie this.

37
00:04:36,639 --> 00:04:39,519
Easy, I've got a bomb on me.

38
00:04:41,240 --> 00:04:43,079
Who did this to you

39
00:04:43,079 --> 00:04:44,439
and put you on the train?

40
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:51,800
The cargo is in the warehouse.

41
00:05:01,519 --> 00:05:03,480
Xiao Mao, what are you delivering today?

42
00:05:13,439 --> 00:05:16,040
Boss, he's here.

43
00:05:35,279 --> 00:05:37,000
Xiao Mao, what are you doing here?

44
00:05:38,079 --> 00:05:39,160
The kitchen is in the back.

45
00:05:39,680 --> 00:05:40,480
Xiao Mao?

46
00:05:41,079 --> 00:05:42,920
Don't touch me! Don't touch me!

47
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:43,839
There's a bomb!

48
00:05:44,279 --> 00:05:45,959
Attention, everyone! There's a bomb!

49
00:05:46,160 --> 00:05:47,319
Don't touch me!

50
00:05:50,879 --> 00:05:52,480
Sha Lan, don't get cocky. I'm telling you,

51
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:53,959
I'm definitely going to beat you!

52
00:05:54,959 --> 00:05:55,959
Let me tell you,

53
00:05:56,439 --> 00:05:58,199
you want to beat me?

54
00:05:58,319 --> 00:05:59,560
Not even close.

55
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:01,639
Watch me drop a bomb on you first!

56
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:06,759
Mr. Xiang, there's a bomb!

57
00:06:06,839 --> 00:06:08,279
I know, I'm dodging it right now!

58
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:12,879
There's a real bomb outside!

59
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:14,160
Hurry!

60
00:06:17,040 --> 00:06:17,879
He's right there.

61
00:06:21,319 --> 00:06:22,120
Stay calm.

62
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:24,040
Tell us what you want.

63
00:06:24,680 --> 00:06:26,040
I'm not a suicide bomber!

64
00:06:26,319 --> 00:06:28,439
They forced this bomb vest on me!

65
00:06:31,279 --> 00:06:32,079
Wei Tian!

66
00:06:32,560 --> 00:06:33,439
Who's Wei Tian?

67
00:06:33,759 --> 00:06:34,959
I... I need to find Wei Tian!

68
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:37,399
Wei Tian!

69
00:06:38,439 --> 00:06:39,759
I need to see Wei Tian!

70
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:40,600
Easy there.

71
00:06:40,920 --> 00:06:42,439
We'll bring Wei Tian here right now.

72
00:06:44,160 --> 00:06:45,959
Thanks for taking a walk with me.

73
00:06:46,560 --> 00:06:48,839
It's rarely this nice and pleasant out.

74
00:06:51,079 --> 00:06:51,879
Actually...

75
00:06:52,519 --> 00:06:53,720
I wish that every day,

76
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:56,040
you could take walks with me like this.

77
00:06:56,680 --> 00:06:59,040
Then I wouldn't worry about your safety,

78
00:06:59,319 --> 00:07:01,079
or fear you might suddenly disappear.

79
00:07:04,680 --> 00:07:05,240
Wei Tian.

80
00:07:05,560 --> 00:07:07,199
Someone at Zhong'an has a bomb strapped to him.

81
00:07:07,199 --> 00:07:07,959
He's asking for you,

82
00:07:07,959 --> 00:07:09,759
and insists on seeing you. Get over here fast!

83
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:10,720
Copy that.

84
00:07:12,319 --> 00:07:13,639
I can't walk you back.

85
00:07:13,959 --> 00:07:15,040
Head back to the hotel on your own.

86
00:07:16,319 --> 00:07:17,000
Wait...

87
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:17,879
Be careful!

88
00:07:18,040 --> 00:07:19,399
Why the rush?

89
00:07:51,600 --> 00:07:52,399
Don't move.

90
00:07:55,079 --> 00:07:55,879
Stay seated.

91
00:08:14,199 --> 00:08:15,439
Calm down. Calm down.

92
00:08:16,199 --> 00:08:18,240
It seems the more agitated you get, the faster it ticks.

93
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:19,600
Quiet!

94
00:08:20,279 --> 00:08:21,360
Quiet, quiet!

95
00:08:22,560 --> 00:08:23,040
Xiang Bei.

96
00:08:23,040 --> 00:08:23,480
Here.

97
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:24,959
Bring the conductor here.

98
00:08:24,959 --> 00:08:25,319
Yes, sir.

99
00:08:32,519 --> 00:08:33,360
Douglas.

100
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:35,840
How did this happen to you?

101
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:38,240
After I attended the security meeting,

102
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,720
just as I was getting ready to leave the hotel,

103
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:41,200
I was suddenly ambushed.

104
00:08:41,399 --> 00:08:43,039
They knocked me unconscious.

105
00:08:43,279 --> 00:08:46,399
When I woke up, I was already like this.

106
00:08:46,399 --> 00:08:48,320
All right, I understand. Stop talking.

107
00:08:48,679 --> 00:08:49,559
Who did this?

108
00:08:50,600 --> 00:08:51,639
I have no idea!

109
00:08:51,639 --> 00:08:53,840
Okay, okay, stop talking.

110
00:08:54,440 --> 00:08:57,759
Wei Tian! Wei Tian! Wei Tian!

111
00:08:58,480 --> 00:08:59,279
I'm right here.

112
00:08:59,559 --> 00:09:00,440
You're Wei Tian.

113
00:09:01,360 --> 00:09:03,039
Help me... I...

114
00:09:03,759 --> 00:09:04,559
Answer the phone.

115
00:09:06,039 --> 00:09:06,600
Don't answer it.

116
00:09:07,440 --> 00:09:08,240
Everyone...

117
00:09:09,159 --> 00:09:11,159
Not strapping bombs to you

118
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:13,039
is my way of being polite.

119
00:09:13,080 --> 00:09:15,559
Wei Tian, a word in private.

120
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:19,919
Go ahead.

121
00:09:20,360 --> 00:09:23,279
Wei Tian, looking at this bomb,

122
00:09:23,279 --> 00:09:24,799
what are your thoughts?

123
00:09:26,399 --> 00:09:28,240
You're trying to make me remember you.

124
00:09:30,360 --> 00:09:31,720
That's right.

125
00:09:33,399 --> 00:09:35,399
I just finished this work of art,

126
00:09:35,639 --> 00:09:37,559
and couldn't wait to show it to you.

127
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:39,919
Take a very close look at it.

128
00:09:40,600 --> 00:09:44,360
I poured my heart and soul into this.

129
00:09:46,639 --> 00:09:48,960
So, isn't it beautiful?

130
00:09:56,039 --> 00:09:58,279
The bomb's design and mechanism are very complex.

131
00:09:58,720 --> 00:10:01,600
Plus, it's linked to his heart rate.

132
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:03,440
The faster his heart beats,

133
00:10:03,440 --> 00:10:05,120
the faster the detonation countdown goes.

134
00:10:05,720 --> 00:10:06,720
It's very likely

135
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:08,279
a remote-controlled system.

136
00:10:10,240 --> 00:10:11,279
Time is running out.

137
00:10:11,600 --> 00:10:13,679
We should initiate standard defusal procedures.

138
00:10:14,440 --> 00:10:15,240
We can't rush this.

139
00:10:16,799 --> 00:10:18,120
This is a Gemini Bomb.

140
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:21,840
It's linked to another bomb vest.

141
00:10:23,080 --> 00:10:25,000
Sha Lan, track it down.

142
00:10:25,320 --> 00:10:27,639
Don't worry, I'll find it.

143
00:10:34,679 --> 00:10:36,679
Control your heart rate. Stay calm.

144
00:10:45,039 --> 00:10:45,840
Excuse me.

145
00:10:46,679 --> 00:10:48,519
My friend here has a bomb on him.

146
00:10:49,399 --> 00:10:52,720
Everyone in this car must be evacuated.

147
00:10:52,960 --> 00:10:54,960
Got it. Let's move, hurry!

148
00:10:57,159 --> 00:10:58,279
Excuse me, wake up.

149
00:10:58,279 --> 00:10:59,080
Please wake up.

150
00:11:01,759 --> 00:11:03,600
Wake up! You need to get out.

151
00:11:16,320 --> 00:11:17,799
That's their phone, right?

152
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:21,279
Sounds like it's over here.

153
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:24,200
Don't move!

154
00:11:46,519 --> 00:11:49,519
Should I answer it or not?

155
00:11:49,720 --> 00:11:50,519
Answer it.

156
00:11:51,039 --> 00:11:52,960
They said we have to.

157
00:11:53,200 --> 00:11:53,639
All right.

158
00:12:00,200 --> 00:12:01,279
Congratulations

159
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:03,320
on being the chosen ones.

160
00:12:03,720 --> 00:12:05,279
You have the privilege of witnessing

161
00:12:06,200 --> 00:12:07,879
my work of art.

162
00:12:08,919 --> 00:12:10,840
When I built this bomb,

163
00:12:11,360 --> 00:12:12,879
in my head,

164
00:12:13,360 --> 00:12:14,679
I kept thinking of

165
00:12:15,360 --> 00:12:17,720
Castor from Greek mythology

166
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:19,600
and Pollux.

167
00:12:21,120 --> 00:12:23,159
The elder brother was mortal;

168
00:12:23,720 --> 00:12:25,480
the younger brother was a god.

169
00:12:26,360 --> 00:12:28,240
When the elder brother lost his life,

170
00:12:29,200 --> 00:12:31,440
the younger brother was willing

171
00:12:31,440 --> 00:12:32,480
to share the rest of his life with him.

172
00:12:34,039 --> 00:12:36,080
But among all of you,

173
00:12:36,639 --> 00:12:38,559
who would be willing to share

174
00:12:38,559 --> 00:12:39,879
their life with someone else?

175
00:12:42,159 --> 00:12:43,519
Now, why don't you guess:

176
00:12:43,879 --> 00:12:46,399
where is the next bomb?

177
00:13:08,039 --> 00:13:08,840
What did you find out?

178
00:13:09,559 --> 00:13:10,480
I asked around.

179
00:13:10,519 --> 00:13:12,159
The guy who delivers food to Zhong'an

180
00:13:12,159 --> 00:13:13,320
lives alone.

181
00:13:13,360 --> 00:13:14,799
He rarely talks

182
00:13:15,000 --> 00:13:16,200
and has no enemies.

183
00:13:17,799 --> 00:13:19,679
Looks like the bomb planter

184
00:13:20,480 --> 00:13:21,799
is very experienced.

185
00:13:22,000 --> 00:13:23,960
He must've watched him for a long time

186
00:13:24,279 --> 00:13:27,120
to nail down the Zhong'an delivery guy's routine.

187
00:13:27,519 --> 00:13:28,960
He bides his time,

188
00:13:29,120 --> 00:13:30,840
and when he strikes, he's very cautious.

189
00:13:30,840 --> 00:13:33,480
Plus, finding his hideout won't be easy.

190
00:13:35,360 --> 00:13:37,879
Someone like him won't hide far away.

191
00:13:38,759 --> 00:13:40,840
He relishes the whole bombing process,

192
00:13:40,840 --> 00:13:42,720
and joins right in

193
00:13:42,720 --> 00:13:43,679
as if playing a game.

194
00:13:44,440 --> 00:13:45,960
He'll probably come looking for us soon.

195
00:13:46,120 --> 00:13:47,039
Let's get in the car.

196
00:13:59,200 --> 00:14:00,159
You're right.

197
00:14:00,519 --> 00:14:01,799
There really are two bombs.

198
00:14:02,240 --> 00:14:04,279
They're linked together.

199
00:14:04,440 --> 00:14:06,120
They must be defused simultaneously

200
00:14:06,639 --> 00:14:07,600
to be safe.

201
00:14:07,639 --> 00:14:09,679
Sha Lan, is there any way

202
00:14:10,080 --> 00:14:12,320
to cut off his remote control

203
00:14:12,759 --> 00:14:14,440
and separate the two bombs?

204
00:14:14,600 --> 00:14:15,600
That might take...

205
00:14:15,879 --> 00:14:16,720
Let me try.

206
00:14:17,279 --> 00:14:18,120
Please...

207
00:14:19,240 --> 00:14:20,080
I'm begging you!

208
00:14:20,200 --> 00:14:21,559
Y-You have to save me!

209
00:14:22,200 --> 00:14:23,039
Calm down.

210
00:14:24,879 --> 00:14:25,919
Don't panic.

211
00:14:26,240 --> 00:14:27,440
We'll definitely help you.

212
00:14:27,480 --> 00:14:28,279
Okay.

213
00:14:30,080 --> 00:14:30,960
Wei Tian, look.

214
00:14:31,720 --> 00:14:32,679
There are two dots here.

215
00:14:34,480 --> 00:14:35,519
At this speed...

216
00:14:36,279 --> 00:14:37,840
It must be on a train.

217
00:14:38,720 --> 00:14:39,879
Let me check the coordinates.

218
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:43,279
Look at the speed. It's really fast.

219
00:14:44,799 --> 00:14:46,159
The coordinates show it's on

220
00:14:47,000 --> 00:14:49,679
the tracks heading to Antilocaris.

221
00:14:49,679 --> 00:14:50,399
The tracks?

222
00:14:51,159 --> 00:14:54,440
Right, the bomb is on that train.

223
00:14:58,279 --> 00:14:59,080
A train?

224
00:15:01,200 --> 00:15:03,200
My dad should be on that train right now!

225
00:15:03,720 --> 00:15:05,559
He's heading back to Antilocaris today.

226
00:15:06,360 --> 00:15:08,240
No, I have to call him.

227
00:15:08,279 --> 00:15:09,519
Xiang Lai, calm down!

228
00:15:09,799 --> 00:15:10,919
One wrong move,

229
00:15:11,519 --> 00:15:13,720
and we'll fall right into his trap.

230
00:15:34,399 --> 00:15:35,200
Captain.

231
00:15:37,559 --> 00:15:39,200
The killer left no clues.

232
00:15:39,440 --> 00:15:40,679
How is the situation here?

233
00:15:41,559 --> 00:15:43,399
These two are Gemini Bombs.

234
00:15:43,759 --> 00:15:46,360
Tampering with one will detonate the other.

235
00:15:46,600 --> 00:15:48,320
And the other bomb...

236
00:15:48,440 --> 00:15:50,159
...is on Xiang Pingsheng's train.

237
00:15:51,120 --> 00:15:53,440
I've stopped the computer intrusion.

238
00:15:54,120 --> 00:15:56,440
Now, to defuse the bombs,

239
00:15:56,440 --> 00:15:57,519
there are two ways.

240
00:15:57,919 --> 00:16:00,519
The first is to defuse both bombs simultaneously.

241
00:16:01,120 --> 00:16:02,240
The second way is...

242
00:16:02,919 --> 00:16:04,360
to enter their passcode.

243
00:16:04,879 --> 00:16:06,200
It'll just take a lot of time.

244
00:16:06,320 --> 00:16:07,240
Wish me luck.

245
00:16:08,320 --> 00:16:09,600
How can we crack the passcode?

246
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:11,519
I need time to trace...

247
00:16:11,519 --> 00:16:13,399
where the controller for both bombs is.

248
00:16:13,679 --> 00:16:15,240
Based on the transmission range,

249
00:16:15,399 --> 00:16:16,480
it should be within a radius...

250
00:16:16,759 --> 00:16:18,120
...of less than one kilometer.

251
00:16:18,519 --> 00:16:19,919
However, it's heavily concealed.

252
00:16:20,399 --> 00:16:22,080
It's hard to pinpoint the exact location.

253
00:16:25,840 --> 00:16:27,759
Is this whole thing just a smokescreen?

254
00:16:37,080 --> 00:16:37,639
Wei Tian.

255
00:16:37,919 --> 00:16:38,519
It's me.

256
00:16:39,039 --> 00:16:41,159
Are you guys in trouble over there?

257
00:16:42,360 --> 00:16:43,159
Yes.

258
00:16:43,600 --> 00:16:45,519
There's one on your train, too.

259
00:16:45,960 --> 00:16:46,919
You're telling me.

260
00:16:47,240 --> 00:16:48,320
On the train,

261
00:16:48,320 --> 00:16:50,879
I found Douglas from Deep Sea Group.

262
00:16:51,360 --> 00:16:53,919
He's strapped with a bomb.

263
00:16:54,600 --> 00:16:56,919
And it's a Gemini Bomb.

264
00:16:56,919 --> 00:16:57,679
I know.

265
00:16:58,600 --> 00:17:01,120
They must be defused at the exact same time.

266
00:17:01,960 --> 00:17:03,399
He's using a remote trigger.

267
00:17:03,639 --> 00:17:04,440
How's Xiang Lai?

268
00:17:07,680 --> 00:17:08,480
He's fine.

269
00:17:09,240 --> 00:17:10,039
Wei Tian.

270
00:17:11,720 --> 00:17:13,799
The timer on my bomb shows...

271
00:17:13,799 --> 00:17:15,559
...over an hour until detonation.

272
00:17:15,720 --> 00:17:16,599
How about yours?

273
00:17:17,200 --> 00:17:18,400
About the same time.

274
00:17:19,000 --> 00:17:20,519
Did he call you?

275
00:17:20,920 --> 00:17:21,880
We've spoken.

276
00:17:22,000 --> 00:17:22,880
He's playing us.

277
00:17:22,880 --> 00:17:23,599
Wei Tian.

278
00:17:23,960 --> 00:17:26,079
Stay calm. Don't act on impulse.

279
00:17:26,359 --> 00:17:27,160
Don't worry.

280
00:17:28,480 --> 00:17:29,279
I won't.

281
00:17:33,319 --> 00:17:34,119
Sha Lan.

282
00:17:35,000 --> 00:17:36,720
When will the train arrive?

283
00:17:36,720 --> 00:17:37,519
Five o'clock.

284
00:17:38,079 --> 00:17:40,240
We can't just sit here watching time slip away.

285
00:17:45,720 --> 00:17:46,720
Let's get ready.

286
00:17:47,200 --> 00:17:48,839
Rossi, Captain.

287
00:17:49,359 --> 00:17:50,440
Go help Xiang Lai.

288
00:17:50,440 --> 00:17:51,519
Sha Lan, let's go.

289
00:17:54,119 --> 00:17:55,440
Please, save me!

290
00:17:55,720 --> 00:17:56,519
You have to save me!

291
00:17:56,519 --> 00:17:57,759
I don't want to die!

292
00:18:05,839 --> 00:18:08,000
Miss, it's dangerous here. Please step back.

293
00:18:08,240 --> 00:18:09,359
What's happening here?

294
00:18:09,359 --> 00:18:10,720
Miss, please step back.

295
00:18:10,799 --> 00:18:11,839
Wait, I know Mr. Xiang!

296
00:18:11,839 --> 00:18:12,400
Step back!

297
00:18:12,400 --> 00:18:14,039
I... I know your boss.

298
00:18:14,039 --> 00:18:14,799
Let me... let me in, I...

299
00:18:14,799 --> 00:18:15,440
An Da.

300
00:18:15,559 --> 00:18:16,759
What are you doing here?

301
00:18:17,319 --> 00:18:18,680
Wh-What happened here?

302
00:18:20,200 --> 00:18:22,480
Someone planted a time bomb here.

303
00:18:23,359 --> 00:18:26,039
Where's Wei Tian? I'll go find him.

304
00:18:26,720 --> 00:18:27,799
Wei Tian isn't here.

305
00:18:27,799 --> 00:18:29,079
He has his own mission.

306
00:18:29,960 --> 00:18:32,000
Th-Then I'll wait for him here.

307
00:18:33,599 --> 00:18:36,000
An Da, this is the Silent Protectors' battlefield.

308
00:18:36,119 --> 00:18:37,440
You don't belong here.

309
00:18:39,440 --> 00:18:41,559
If you're truly worried about Wei Tian,

310
00:18:41,799 --> 00:18:43,799
please go somewhere safe.

311
00:18:44,160 --> 00:18:45,039
Take care of yourself.

312
00:18:45,039 --> 00:18:46,920
Keep yourself out of danger.

313
00:18:47,119 --> 00:18:48,920
That's the best way you can help him.

314
00:19:59,359 --> 00:20:00,160
Wei Tian.

315
00:20:01,559 --> 00:20:03,359
The signal's getting stronger.

316
00:20:35,920 --> 00:20:36,720
Wei Tian.

317
00:20:39,079 --> 00:20:40,680
Let's go. I found it.

318
00:21:07,839 --> 00:21:11,440
Xiang Pingsheng, it... it's speeding up.

319
00:21:11,440 --> 00:21:12,799
What should I do?

320
00:21:12,799 --> 00:21:13,480
Don't move.

321
00:21:16,559 --> 00:21:17,359
Douglas.

322
00:21:18,079 --> 00:21:19,759
If you trust me,

323
00:21:20,839 --> 00:21:22,799
we'll start defusing the bomb right now.

324
00:21:22,839 --> 00:21:23,640
What do you say?

325
00:21:23,960 --> 00:21:26,079
I trust you. You can do this.

326
00:21:26,920 --> 00:21:27,559
Get the tools.

327
00:21:27,839 --> 00:21:28,200
Yes, sir.

328
00:21:31,759 --> 00:21:32,519
Steady.

329
00:23:07,440 --> 00:23:10,559
Xiang Lai, be ready to retreat at any moment.

330
00:23:11,839 --> 00:23:13,720
Xiang Lai, you can't act on impulse.

331
00:23:21,920 --> 00:23:22,319
Dad.

332
00:23:29,839 --> 00:23:32,160
Xiang Pingsheng, can you handle this?

333
00:23:33,720 --> 00:23:34,759
What do you mean, can I?

334
00:23:35,440 --> 00:23:36,880
You have no choice.

335
00:24:03,279 --> 00:24:05,279
Ready? Go.

336
00:24:14,480 --> 00:24:14,960
Split up.

337
00:24:30,799 --> 00:24:33,519
Damn it! Damn it! Damn it!

338
00:25:08,599 --> 00:25:09,680
Are you okay? You're not hurt?

339
00:25:09,680 --> 00:25:10,119
I'm fine.

340
00:25:11,519 --> 00:25:12,599
The location is roughly over that way.

341
00:25:12,599 --> 00:25:13,039
Let's move.

342
00:25:42,359 --> 00:25:43,000
Be careful.

343
00:26:09,480 --> 00:26:10,119
Careful.

344
00:26:13,319 --> 00:26:14,319
The hard drive was destroyed in the blast.

345
00:26:31,400 --> 00:26:33,839
20 minutes. Catch me, and everyone lives.

346
00:26:36,079 --> 00:26:37,799
What color is the defusal wire usually?

347
00:26:37,799 --> 00:26:38,680
Red.

348
00:26:40,440 --> 00:26:42,960
Then let's cut the red one first.

349
00:26:43,880 --> 00:26:44,920
No, no, no!

350
00:26:45,279 --> 00:26:47,319
Stop being so jumpy, will you?

351
00:26:47,640 --> 00:26:50,279
My lucky color is dark brown.

352
00:26:51,400 --> 00:26:53,359
There's no dark brown here at all!

353
00:26:53,599 --> 00:26:55,119
Dad, let me do it.

354
00:26:55,480 --> 00:26:56,240
I'm more experienced at this than you are.

355
00:26:57,440 --> 00:26:58,079
All right. Go ahead.

356
00:27:17,279 --> 00:27:18,079
Wei Tian.

357
00:27:18,079 --> 00:27:18,839
Rossi.

358
00:27:20,079 --> 00:27:21,119
He got away from me.

359
00:27:22,319 --> 00:27:23,759
Tell Xiang Pingsheng and Xiang Lai

360
00:27:24,640 --> 00:27:25,440
to get ready for bomb disposal.

361
00:27:27,480 --> 00:27:27,960
Understood.

362
00:27:29,880 --> 00:27:30,440
He...

363
00:27:44,559 --> 00:27:46,480
Xiang Pingsheng, don't leave.

364
00:27:47,400 --> 00:27:49,400
I'm not leaving. I'm right here with you.

365
00:27:56,240 --> 00:27:57,279
This is Qu Shengli.

366
00:27:58,480 --> 00:27:59,279
Where's Wei Tian?

367
00:27:59,599 --> 00:28:00,480
He's safe.

368
00:28:00,519 --> 00:28:02,480
But we didn't catch the guy.

369
00:28:04,400 --> 00:28:05,200
Alright.

370
00:28:06,279 --> 00:28:07,480
Then we'll prepare to defuse the bomb.

371
00:28:08,920 --> 00:28:10,000
Who's on your end?

372
00:28:11,519 --> 00:28:12,160
Xiang Lai.

373
00:28:14,519 --> 00:28:15,079
Stay calm.

374
00:28:17,200 --> 00:28:20,000
On our end, it's Xiang Bei.

375
00:28:27,680 --> 00:28:30,599
Xiang Lai, I'm patching your father's call through.

376
00:28:30,920 --> 00:28:31,319
Lai.

377
00:28:31,400 --> 00:28:31,839
Yes.

378
00:28:33,640 --> 00:28:34,079
Good.

379
00:28:46,559 --> 00:28:48,680
We're running out of time. Ten minutes left.

380
00:28:49,000 --> 00:28:51,799
Bro, looks like we're fighting side by side this time.

381
00:28:52,119 --> 00:28:54,440
Xiao Bei, why is it you? Where's Dad?

382
00:28:54,839 --> 00:28:56,319
Dad and I are on the train.

383
00:28:56,720 --> 00:28:57,599
Defusing the bomb comes first.

384
00:28:57,759 --> 00:28:58,880
We'll talk when we get back.

385
00:28:59,960 --> 00:29:01,799
Okay, follow my lead.

386
00:29:02,279 --> 00:29:02,720
Got it.

387
00:29:19,240 --> 00:29:21,079
Wei Tian, the father and son

388
00:29:21,079 --> 00:29:22,119
are already prepared.

389
00:29:28,240 --> 00:29:30,200
I've already recovered 20% of the data,

390
00:29:30,200 --> 00:29:31,559
but I still need a lot more time.

391
00:29:34,559 --> 00:29:36,039
Calm down, Mr. Douglas.

392
00:29:36,559 --> 00:29:37,599
Calm down. Easy.

393
00:29:37,799 --> 00:29:38,559
If you get agitated,

394
00:29:38,559 --> 00:29:40,240
it'll shorten the bomb's detonation countdown.

395
00:29:41,720 --> 00:29:42,519
All right.

396
00:29:46,079 --> 00:29:47,839
Bro, which wire do we cut?

397
00:30:07,160 --> 00:30:08,519
Let's pick a color we like.

398
00:30:09,839 --> 00:30:10,519
Red.

399
00:30:14,200 --> 00:30:15,000
Listen to me.

400
00:30:15,720 --> 00:30:16,519
Cut the blue one.

401
00:30:18,279 --> 00:30:18,720
Okay.

402
00:30:53,680 --> 00:30:54,519
Why is it still moving?

403
00:30:55,240 --> 00:30:56,319
Wasn't it the blue wire?

404
00:30:57,400 --> 00:30:58,480
Could it be the red one?

405
00:31:07,680 --> 00:31:09,480
Wei Tian, the timer is still running.

406
00:31:36,920 --> 00:31:39,599
Rossi, let's take a gamble.

407
00:31:42,839 --> 00:31:43,799
Cut the yellow wire.

408
00:31:44,000 --> 00:31:44,799
Yellow.

409
00:31:45,720 --> 00:31:47,480
Xiao Bei, cut the yellow wire.

410
00:31:48,039 --> 00:31:48,839
Yellow.

411
00:31:49,200 --> 00:31:51,559
Bro, I only have a red one left here.

412
00:31:51,559 --> 00:31:52,240
Then why do I

413
00:31:52,240 --> 00:31:53,920
still have both a red and a yellow wire?

414
00:31:55,640 --> 00:31:56,839
Bro, time is running out.

415
00:31:56,839 --> 00:31:57,880
Let's cut the red ones together.

416
00:31:58,119 --> 00:32:00,759
Xiao Bei, listen to me. Don't be rash.

417
00:32:05,039 --> 00:32:08,039
Xiao Bei, how much time do you have left?

418
00:32:09,559 --> 00:32:10,400
Four and a half minutes.

419
00:32:11,039 --> 00:32:13,000
Bro, we're out of time. Let's take a gamble.

420
00:32:15,400 --> 00:32:17,079
These two are Gemini Bombs.

421
00:32:17,400 --> 00:32:18,319
Tampering with one

422
00:32:18,359 --> 00:32:20,000
will detonate the other bomb.

423
00:32:20,720 --> 00:32:22,440
And the other bomb

424
00:32:22,559 --> 00:32:24,119
is on Xiang Pingsheng's train.

425
00:32:24,359 --> 00:32:26,400
That means the yellow wire is the right one.

426
00:32:26,640 --> 00:32:27,720
If I cut it on my end,

427
00:32:27,759 --> 00:32:29,200
the one on the train will detonate immediately.

428
00:32:29,559 --> 00:32:31,039
If both sides cut the red wire

429
00:32:31,079 --> 00:32:31,960
and keep the yellow wire,

430
00:32:32,279 --> 00:32:34,319
the remote will still detonate both bombs.

431
00:32:34,920 --> 00:32:36,799
It seems defusing both simultaneously is impossible.

432
00:32:37,079 --> 00:32:38,839
Xiao Bei, don't cut it yet.

433
00:32:39,000 --> 00:32:39,839
I have an idea.

434
00:32:52,119 --> 00:32:53,839
Actually, they knew all along

435
00:32:54,359 --> 00:32:56,920
that we could only defuse one of the two bombs.

436
00:32:57,759 --> 00:32:59,960
They just wanted us to choose for ourselves.

437
00:33:01,640 --> 00:33:02,440
What are you doing?

438
00:33:03,160 --> 00:33:04,519
They sent you, didn't they?

439
00:33:14,079 --> 00:33:15,319
You figured it out too late.

440
00:33:18,039 --> 00:33:19,200
Trading my life

441
00:33:20,240 --> 00:33:21,400
to save a train full of people...

442
00:33:23,079 --> 00:33:23,640
It's worth it.

443
00:33:53,039 --> 00:33:53,799
Xiang Lai!

444
00:33:55,119 --> 00:33:57,920
Brother! Brother!

445
00:33:58,920 --> 00:33:59,359
Hurry!

446
00:34:02,400 --> 00:34:03,279
Xiang Lai! Xiang Lai!

447
00:34:05,400 --> 00:34:05,960
Xiang Lai!

448
00:34:06,000 --> 00:34:06,400
Xiang Lai!

449
00:34:06,400 --> 00:34:07,039
Hang in there!

450
00:34:07,039 --> 00:34:07,559
Xiang Lai!

451
00:34:08,039 --> 00:34:09,000
Xiang Lai, hang in there!

452
00:34:09,199 --> 00:34:09,880
Dad...

453
00:34:11,760 --> 00:34:16,880
I won't be able to spar with you anymore.

454
00:34:21,199 --> 00:34:23,280
Luckily, Xiao Bei is here.

455
00:34:23,920 --> 00:34:27,280
He hits hard.

456
00:34:29,000 --> 00:34:32,679
Don't go easy on him.

457
00:34:35,280 --> 00:34:42,119
Xiao Bei, Zhong'an is in your hands now.

458
00:34:43,360 --> 00:34:48,639
You're the best of the best.

459
00:34:59,719 --> 00:35:00,440
Xiang Lai!

460
00:35:00,840 --> 00:35:01,480
Xiang Lai!

461
00:35:02,320 --> 00:35:03,920
Xiang Lai! Xiang Lai! Xiang Lai!

462
00:35:04,480 --> 00:35:05,400
Xiang Lai!

463
00:35:05,840 --> 00:35:06,599
Call an ambulance, quick!

464
00:35:06,599 --> 00:35:07,840
Xiang Lai!

465
00:35:08,320 --> 00:35:09,119
Xiang Lai!

466
00:35:10,400 --> 00:35:11,199
Xiang Lai!

467
00:35:32,800 --> 00:35:35,480
The recent bomb attack

468
00:35:35,480 --> 00:35:37,000
in Antilocaris

469
00:35:37,000 --> 00:35:38,000
severely threatened

470
00:35:38,000 --> 00:35:39,960
people's lives, property, and safety.

471
00:35:39,960 --> 00:35:41,320
Zhong'an Group, with their

472
00:35:41,320 --> 00:35:43,119
courage and the price of blood,

473
00:35:43,599 --> 00:35:46,440
defended the peace and tranquility of this land.

474
00:35:46,440 --> 00:35:48,360
We also saw the Chinese security industry's

475
00:35:48,360 --> 00:35:50,960
resolve to fight criminals overseas.

476
00:35:51,239 --> 00:35:53,400
I want to pay tribute to Zhong'an Group,

477
00:35:53,760 --> 00:35:55,639
and to the one who heroically sacrificed his life,

478
00:35:55,679 --> 00:35:58,320
the Security Officer who saved a train full of people—

479
00:35:58,320 --> 00:35:59,719
I salute Xiang Lai.

480
00:36:55,320 --> 00:36:57,079
Xiang Bei, open the door.

481
00:37:03,039 --> 00:37:04,400
Are you asleep already?

482
00:37:09,039 --> 00:37:11,840
Xiang Bei, I know you're awake.

483
00:37:12,039 --> 00:37:12,840
Open up.

484
00:37:17,920 --> 00:37:18,719
Xiang Bei!

485
00:37:19,760 --> 00:37:21,760
Open the door now! That's an order!

486
00:37:31,000 --> 00:37:33,199
You, get this door open.

487
00:37:33,480 --> 00:37:34,760
Drag him out here.

488
00:37:35,840 --> 00:37:36,519
Me?

489
00:37:36,519 --> 00:37:37,719
Are you disobeying an order?

490
00:37:37,920 --> 00:37:38,280
No, sir.

491
00:37:39,480 --> 00:37:40,400
But I don't have a key.

492
00:37:40,400 --> 00:37:42,519
You can't open a door without a key?

493
00:37:43,199 --> 00:37:43,679
Yes, sir.

494
00:37:44,199 --> 00:37:44,760
Hurry!

495
00:37:47,440 --> 00:37:49,239
Dad, I just want to be alone.

496
00:37:51,320 --> 00:37:51,920
Get up.

497
00:37:54,960 --> 00:37:55,920
Get on your feet!

498
00:37:58,559 --> 00:37:59,119
Stand up straight!

499
00:38:00,760 --> 00:38:02,400
Crying your eyes out all day...

500
00:38:02,880 --> 00:38:03,760
Like a little girl.

501
00:38:04,239 --> 00:38:05,280
I miss my brother.

502
00:38:14,599 --> 00:38:15,559
Wipe your tears.

503
00:38:16,639 --> 00:38:17,320
Come with me.

504
00:38:35,519 --> 00:38:36,000
Dad,

505
00:38:37,159 --> 00:38:38,480
I don't want to stay here another minute.

506
00:38:38,880 --> 00:38:39,880
I want to go back to China.

507
00:38:44,320 --> 00:38:45,440
Whenever I close my eyes,

508
00:38:45,440 --> 00:38:47,320
all I hear are my brother's last words.

509
00:38:48,880 --> 00:38:50,760
I... there was nothing I could do.

510
00:38:50,760 --> 00:38:52,199
All I could do was watch...

511
00:38:58,119 --> 00:39:01,239
Dad, what am I supposed to do?

512
00:39:18,360 --> 00:39:18,800
Take this.

513
00:39:25,719 --> 00:39:26,800
What do you mean by this?

514
00:39:29,679 --> 00:39:30,800
Are you saying that protecting others...

515
00:39:30,800 --> 00:39:32,480
...means we have to sacrifice ourselves? Is that it?

516
00:39:33,840 --> 00:39:34,280
Dad.

517
00:39:37,159 --> 00:39:39,440
Dad, why are you so indifferent?

518
00:39:40,599 --> 00:39:43,079
Xiang Lai is my brother, your own son!

519
00:39:44,360 --> 00:39:45,159
I know.

520
00:39:47,920 --> 00:39:49,400
Your brother is my son.

521
00:39:49,400 --> 00:39:51,679
I know that far better than you.

522
00:40:00,519 --> 00:40:02,800
The name tag in your hand...

523
00:40:04,639 --> 00:40:06,920
...represents the deaths I've lived through.

524
00:40:08,360 --> 00:40:10,400
I've told you their stories.

525
00:40:11,320 --> 00:40:13,000
They were all family to me.

526
00:40:17,920 --> 00:40:19,000
Take it back,

527
00:40:19,679 --> 00:40:21,000
take another good look at it,

528
00:40:21,400 --> 00:40:22,719
think it through,

529
00:40:25,440 --> 00:40:27,559
and you'll know what you should do.

530
00:40:47,280 --> 00:40:48,079
Xiang Lai

531
00:40:49,559 --> 00:40:51,679
Dad made these fried sauce noodles for you.

532
00:40:52,639 --> 00:40:53,599
To tell you the truth,

533
00:40:54,840 --> 00:40:56,159
Dad didn't realize...

534
00:40:56,480 --> 00:40:58,880
that it's been so long since I made them for you.

535
00:41:00,440 --> 00:41:01,719
And I really didn't know...

536
00:41:02,480 --> 00:41:04,960
how much you loved my fried sauce noodles.

537
00:41:05,719 --> 00:41:07,000
A certain veteran leader

538
00:41:07,000 --> 00:41:08,039
has been saying for years

539
00:41:08,039 --> 00:41:09,840
he'd make us Xiang-style noodles.

540
00:41:10,480 --> 00:41:11,599
But we still haven't had any.

541
00:41:11,840 --> 00:41:13,360
I've never tasted Xiang-style noodles.

542
00:41:13,599 --> 00:41:15,679
The last time I ate your noodles...

543
00:41:16,719 --> 00:41:18,119
was right after I lost my baby teeth.

544
00:41:18,480 --> 00:41:20,880
If you want my Xiang-style noodles,

545
00:41:21,760 --> 00:41:23,760
with what little you've achieved,

546
00:41:24,159 --> 00:41:25,119
you don't qualify yet.

547
00:41:27,440 --> 00:41:29,800
I wish both of you great success.

548
00:41:30,079 --> 00:41:31,119
And I wish for myself...

549
00:41:31,239 --> 00:41:33,159
to eat your noodles again soon.

550
00:41:34,719 --> 00:41:36,159
Cut the nonsense.

551
00:41:41,599 --> 00:41:44,840
You've always been a good kid.

552
00:41:45,800 --> 00:41:47,199
Even though you were mischievous,

553
00:41:48,199 --> 00:41:49,519
in every subject,

554
00:41:50,599 --> 00:41:51,800
you got top marks.

555
00:41:52,840 --> 00:41:53,639
The Sail

556
00:41:54,719 --> 00:41:58,360
In the pale blue mist on the sea,

557
00:41:58,599 --> 00:42:01,880
a lone sail gleams in white.

558
00:42:03,000 --> 00:42:06,519
What does it seek in a foreign land?

559
00:42:06,960 --> 00:42:10,119
What did it leave behind in its beloved home?

560
00:42:10,559 --> 00:42:15,559
The waves are surging, the sea wind howling,

561
00:42:16,079 --> 00:42:20,320
the mast bending low and creaking.

562
00:42:21,400 --> 00:42:24,320
It is not seeking happiness,

563
00:42:24,559 --> 00:42:26,360
nor is it fleeing from it,

564
00:42:26,519 --> 00:42:28,199
as it rushes afar.

565
00:42:28,639 --> 00:42:32,599
Below, azure waves clearer than the blue sky;

566
00:42:32,800 --> 00:42:36,800
above, the golden and radiant sun.

567
00:42:36,920 --> 00:42:40,880
Yet restlessly it begs for sustenance,

568
00:42:41,280 --> 00:42:46,639
as if peace could only be found in a storm.

569
00:42:56,400 --> 00:42:58,360
Dad always knew you'd make something of yourself.

570
00:43:01,360 --> 00:43:03,920
But I never thought you'd be this brave.

571
00:43:05,239 --> 00:43:06,039
This time,

572
00:43:07,159 --> 00:43:09,920
to save me and Xiang Bei,

573
00:43:10,559 --> 00:43:14,400
and everyone in that train car, you sacrificed yourself.

574
00:43:20,599 --> 00:43:24,079
Now everyone thinks you're a hero.

575
00:43:26,199 --> 00:43:28,760
But Dad would rather you weren't a hero,

576
00:43:30,119 --> 00:43:31,559
and just came back...

577
00:43:33,559 --> 00:43:35,280
to be my mischievous boy.
